Subject: [PATCH 31/49] x86_64/k1om: imply x86_64/64

sysdeps/x86_64/64 holds LP64-only pieces (dl-tunables.list with
prefer_map_32bit_exec since 2.39, which cpu-features.c reads) and no
shlib-versions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Anselm Busse <anselm.busse@outlook.com>
---
 sysdeps/x86_64/k1om/Implies | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/sysdeps/x86_64/k1om/Implies b/sysdeps/x86_64/k1om/Implies
index 72a1b50d79..cb341390d8 100644
--- a/sysdeps/x86_64/k1om/Implies
+++ b/sysdeps/x86_64/k1om/Implies
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 x86_64/mic
 x86_64/fpu/587
 wordsize-64
+x86_64/64
